oss":"with a mind"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"வல்","parts":[{"text":"வல்","lemma":"辅助","gloss":"strong"}],"gloss":"strong"},{"surface":"வில்","parts":[{"text":"வில்","lemma":"வில்","gloss":"bow"}],"gloss":"bow"},{"surface":"இளையர்","parts":[{"text":"இளையர்","lemma":"இளையர்","gloss":"young attendants"}],"gloss":"young attendants"},{"surface":"பக்கம்","parts":[{"text":"பக்கம்","lemma":"பக்கம்","gloss":"sides"}],"gloss":"sides"},{"surface":"போற்ற","parts":[{"text":"போற்ற","lemma":"போற்று","gloss":"protecting"}],"gloss":"protecting"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"ஈர்மணல்","parts":[{"text":"ஈர்மணல்","lemma":"ஈர்மணல்","gloss":"wet sand"}],"gloss":"wet sand"},{"surface":"காட்டாறு","parts":[{"text":"காட்டாறு","lemma":"காட்டாறு","gloss":"forest river"}],"gloss":"forest river"},{"surface":"வரூஉம்","parts":[{"text":"வரூஉம்","lemma":"வரு","gloss":"coming"}],"gloss":"coming"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"தேர்மணி","parts":[{"text":"தேர்மணி","lemma":"தேர்மணி","gloss":"chariot bells"}],"gloss":"chariot bells"},{"surface":"கொல்","parts":[{"text":"கொல்","lemma":"கொல்","gloss":"or is it"}],"gloss":"or is it"},{"surface":"ஆண்டு","parts":[{"text":"ஆண்டு","lemma":"ஆண்டு","gloss":"there"}],"gloss":"there"},{"surface":"இயம்பிய","parts":[{"text":"இயம்பிய","lemma":"இயம்பு","gloss":"sounded"}],"gloss":"sounded"},{"surface":"உளவே","parts":[{"text":"உளவே","lemma":"உள்","gloss":"they are indeed"}],"gloss":"they are indeed"}]}],"literal":"Climbing the high rock where jasmine has crept, / let us go and see and return, O friend! / Is it the bells worn by the good grass-eating cows of the herd with bulls returning to the village at twilight, / or is it indeed the chariot bells sounding there, coming along the wet-sanded forest river, / while young men with strong bows guard the sides, / with a majestic mind of having completed his duty?","translation":"O friend, shall we climb the high rock overgrown with jasmine and look out? Is that the sound of bells worn by the good grass-eating cows returning to the village at twilight with their bulls? Or is it the sound of bells from his chariot, coming along the wet-sanded forest river, guarded on both sides by young men with strong bows, as he returns with a proud heart, having completed his task?","modern":"தோழியே! முல்லைக்கொடி படர்ந்த உயர்ந்த பாறையின் மேல் ஏறிப் பார்த்துவிட்டு வருவோமா? மாலை நேரத்தில் ஊருக்குத் திரும்பி வருகின்ற காளைகளைக் கொண்ட மந்தையின் புல் மேயும் நல்ல பசுக்கள் கட்டியிருக்கும் மணிகளின் ஓசையா அது? அல்லது, தன் கடமையை முடித்த பெருமித உணர்வோடு, வலிமையான வில்லேந்திய வீரர்கள் பக்கவாட்டில் பாதுகாத்து வர, ஈரமான மணலைக் கொண்ட காட்டாற்றின் வழியே வரும் தலைவனுடைய தேரின் மணி ஓசையா அங்கே ஒலிக்கின்றது?","explanation":"The friend is speaking to the heroine in this Mullai (pastoral) poem. The rainy season has arrived, which is the time the hero promised to return from his mission, and the heroine is waiting anxiously. Hearing a distant sound of bells, the friend suggests climbing a high rock covered with jasmine to see what it is. She wonders aloud if the sound is from the bells of the cattle returning home at twilight, or if it is the chariot of the hero returning triumphantly after completing his duty, escorted by his archers along the forest river. The imagery of the returning herd, the twilight hour, and the sound of bells beautifully evokes the Mullai landscape and the theme of patient waiting.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.42],[0.42,0.9],[0.9,1.12],[1.12,1.39],[1.39,1.84],[1.84,2.2],[2.2,2.5],[2.5,2.9],[2.9,3.48],[3.62,4.2],[4.2,5.0],[5.06,6.09],[6.09,6.61],[6.61,7.01],[7.01,7.4],[7.4,7.6],[7.8,8.2],[8.2,8.6],[8.6,8.9],[8.9,9.3],[9.3,10.6],[10.6,10.8],[10.8,11.3],[11.3,11.6],[11.6,12.5],[12.5,13.0],[13.0,13.4],[13.66,14.3],[14.3,14.68],[14.68,15.3],[15.5,15.7]],"female":[[0.0,0.7],[0.76,1.1],[1.1,1.4],[1.4,1.92],[1.92,2.8],[2.8,3.0],[3.0,3.3],[3.3,3.8],[3.8,4.42],[4.58,5.2],[5.2,6.2],[6.26,6.5],[6.5,7.7],[7.7,8.27],[8.27,8.7],[8.7,8.95],[9.2,10.0],[10.0,10.4],[10.4,10.93],[10.93,11.8],[11.8,12.2],[1